---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure" description={`How ${SITE.name} earns money through Amazon affiliate links, why it never costs you more, and how we keep our reviews independent.`}>
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      {SITE.name} is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program
      designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.
    </p>

    <h2>What does that mean for you?</h2>
    <p>
      As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases. When you click a product link on this site and buy
      something on Amazon, we may receive a small commission. You don't pay anything extra.
    </p>

    <h2>Does it affect our recommendations?</h2>
    <p>
      No. We recommend gear based on how well it suits home producers and creators, not on commission. If a product
      isn't worth your money, we'll say so.
    </p>

    <h2>Why don't we list prices?</h2>
    <p>
      Prices on Amazon change often. To keep things accurate, we link to Amazon so you always see the current price
      there. Amazon and the Amazon logo are trademarks of Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
